---
title: Dumpling 2 Min Noodles
servings: 1
course: dinner
tags: quick, noodle, one-pan
image: https://img.youtube.com/vi/M-PuGg7Ek-w/maxresdefault.jpg
source: https://youtu.be/M-PuGg7Ek-w
time: 15m
---

Bring a #pot{} of @water to the boil and add @frozen dumpling{6}. Stir to prevent sticking and cook for ~{2%minutes}.

Add the seasoning sachets from @instant ramen{1%packet} directly into the boiling water to create a broth, stirring it through. Add the ramen noodles to the top and let them cook.

Slice @spring onion{2}, keeping the white parts cut slightly thicker for texture and finely slicing the green parts.

Once the noodles begin to soften, stir to break them up. Stir in @peanut butter{1%tbsp} to thicken the broth, then add the white parts of the spring onion. Cook until the noodles are tender and the dumplings are hot through, about ~{2%minutes}.

Using #tongs{}, transfer the noodles into a #bowl{}, arrange the dumplings on top, and pour the broth over. Garnish with the sliced green spring onion tops and @chilli crisp{1%tbsp}.
